{"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "theorem", "ucas": "theorem nosummand: forall C:cx, p n r:int, a:el: fintype(C) and prime(p) and 0 <= n and 1 <= r and a in H(C,n) -> not dimg(bock(C,p),r,n-1,j(bock(C,p),a))", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "theorem", "name": "nosummand", "statement": "forall C:cx, p n r:int, a:el: fintype(C) and prime(p) and 0 <= n and 1 <= r and a in H(C, n) -> not dimg(bock(C, p), r, n - 1, j(bock(C, p), a))"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "theorem nosummand: forall C:cx, p n r:int, a:el: fintype(C) and prime(p) and 0 <= n and 1 <= r and a in H(C, n) -> not dimg(bock(C, p), r, n - 1, j(bock(C, p), a))\n"}
{"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "prove", "ucas": "prove nosummand", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "prove", "name": "nosummand", "statement": "forall C:cx, p n r:int, a:el: fintype(C) and prime(p) and 0 <= n and 1 <= r and a in H(C, n) -> not dimg(bock(C, p), r, n - 1, j(bock(C, p), a))", "replays": [{"lemma": "bockstein_paper", "fails": "thy_absalg.thy:1946: no fact, lemma or axiom named hs [step: have hsT: zsummand(a,Hc(C)) by zsummand_trans[a, H(C,n), Hc(C)] hs hsum]"}, {"lemma": "bockstein_coords", "fails": "thy_absalg.thy:2009: no fact, lemma or axiom named hs [step: have hsT: zsummand(a,Hc(C)) by zsummand_trans[a, H(C,n), Hc(C)] hs hsum]"}], "proved": false, "reason": "could not prove forall C:cx, p n r:int, a:el: fintype(C) and prime(p) and 0 <= n and 1 <= r and a in H(C, n) -> not dimg(bock(C, p), r, n - 1, j(bock(C, p), a))", "counterexample": "C = the cochains of S^1, p = 2, n = 0, r = 1, a = [0] in H^0(S^1; Z) = Z"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "  the proof of bockstein_paper does not apply: thy_absalg.thy:1946: no fact, lemma or axiom named hs [step: have hsT: zsummand(a,Hc(C)) by zsummand_trans[a, H(C,n), Hc(C)] hs hsum]\n  the proof of bockstein_coords does not apply: thy_absalg.thy:2009: no fact, lemma or axiom named hs [step: have hsT: zsummand(a,Hc(C)) by zsummand_trans[a, H(C,n), Hc(C)] hs hsum]\nnosummand: NOT proved\n  automation: could not prove forall C:cx, p n r:int, a:el: fintype(C) and prime(p) and 0 <= n and 1 <= r and a in H(C, n) -> not dimg(bock(C, p), r, n - 1, j(bock(C, p), a))\n  counterexample: C = the cochains of S^1, p = 2, n = 0, r = 1, a = [0] in H^0(S^1; Z) = Z\n  (evaluated in a concrete model: complexes are standard spaces' cochains, bock(C,p) homalg.h's exact Bockstein spectral sequence; a computation, not a kernel proof)\n"}
